    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "United\nAirlines\nTop Flights\nto Alaska\nUnited Airlines gives you top connections to Alaska Airlines\nflights in Seattle. To top it off, there's West Coaster service on\nUnited. And Top of the World service on Alaska. Ask your travel\nagent. Or call us. In Los Angeles: 482-2000. In San Francisco:\n397-2100.\nCalifornia to Alaska\nLeave Leave\nLos\nSan\nFlight\nAngeles Francisco\nUA 292\n8:30 A\nUA 388\nUA 290\n10:30 A\nUA 696\nUA 308\n12:35 P\nUA 65\nUA 294\n2:45 P\nUA 420\nUA 458\n7:45 P\nDaily-Eff. 5/15/76\n*Ex. Sat.\nConnect\nin\nSeattle\nAS 93\n9:30 A\nAS 93\nAS 85\n12:00 N\nAS 95\nAS 87\n12:45 P\nAS 87\nAS 97\n4:20 P\nAS 97*\nAS 99*\nArrive\nArrive\nAnchorage Fairbanks\n1:15 P\n2:35 P\n1:15 P\n2:35 P\n2:30 P\n3:55 P\n3:15 P\n4:40 P\n5:35 P\n7:00 P\n5:35 P\n7:00 P\n8:15 P\n9:40 P\n8:15 P\n9:40 P\n11:45 P\n1:10 A\nUJ UNITED AIRLINES/\nAlaska Airlines\n2007.011,255",
